// Google readers (docs/runbooks/google.md; 06 C3 to C5, changed 2026-11-15), on Adam's picks of
// 2026-11-15: Adam's own Google account, read-only (D2), and full detail only in the OpenClaw app (D4).
// Applied by scripts/pc/install-google.sh plugin, only after the P5 gate passes; that script also adds
// calendar_read, mail_read, mail_open and contact_search to main's live tool list and jorah-google to
// plugins.allow. jorah-guard lists all four as taintRead: after one, Jorah's actions need a tap.
// No secret here: the keyring password and the token live in jorah's home, mode 600.
{
  plugins: {
    entries: {
      "jorah-google": {
        enabled: true,
        config: {
          gogPath: "/opt/jorah-tools/gog/gog",
          gogHome: "/home/jorah/.local/share/jorah-google/gog",
          passwordFile: "/home/jorah/.config/jorah-google/keyring-password",
          account: "adam",
          timeZone: "Europe/Bratislava",
          detailChannels: ["webchat"],
          timeoutMs: 20000,
        },
      },
    },
  },
}
